# Research boundary

- Replay historical ITCH and simulate. Do not add an order gateway or a broker client.
- Every signal report includes drop counts and a cost haircut. Half the spread is a lower bound, not a fill. Say that queue position and adverse selection are not modeled.
- Do not hide truncated books. Liquid names hit the per-symbol pool cap; the study uses one symbol with a large pool instead of raising the full-market cap.
- Do not describe a decile table as a tradable edge.
- CSV output stays under `data/` (gitignored). Do not commit market data.
